{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44829","headline":"月夜有怀黄端公兼简朱孙二判官 · 清江","name":"月夜有怀黄端公兼简朱孙二判官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月照疎林惊鹊飞，羁人此夜共无依。\n青门旅寓身空老，白首头陀力渐微。\n屡向曲池陪逸少，几回戎幕接玄晖。\n四科弟子称文学，五马诸侯是绣衣。\n江雁往来曾不定，野云摇曳本无机。\n修行未尽身将尽，欲向东山掩旧扉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"清江","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44829.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44829","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}